<title>JAPAN: New Oji - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>New Oji - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		299.34		vs	  295.54</p>
<p> Operating	   23.21		vs	   27.80</p>
<p> Current	     22.02		vs	   22.51</p>
<p> Net		   12.57		vs	    8.53</p>
<p> EPS		   16.92 yen	  vs	   11.48 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    743 million	  vs	 743 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p> -Special div	 0.50 yen	  vs	    0.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - New Oji Paper Co Ltd merged with Honshu Paper</p>
<p>Co Ltd on October 1 to become Oji Paper Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
